info.description:
Complete API collection for MarketMaster Multi-Tenant ERP System (Uganda MMIS). Covers all 70+ backend routes across Auth, Market Registry, Vendor & Product Management, Financial Operations, Gate & Token System, Supply Chain, KYC/Document Pipeline, Audit & Compliance, and Support Hub. Updated to reflect Phase 3 Financial & Inventory implementation.

Base URL: {{baseUrl}} (default: http://localhost:5000/api)
All protected routes require: Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

